ind":"update","title":"Sanslo Demo Update!","summary":"■ Revamped General Recruitment SystemThe previous fully randomized recruitment system has been replaced with a new system that randomly selects up to six available generals.You can now freely recruit any of the selected generals, as long as you have enough Reward Points.This gives you more control over recruitment, allowing you to choose generals based on your current squad and strategy.■ Special Move GaugeA new Special Move Gauge has been added.When Special Move symbols stop on the reels but do","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T08:49:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385472","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4899480-1842212951309395","game_id":"steam-4899480","kind":"announcement","title":"さんすろ体験版 アップデート","summary":"The Sanslo Demo Has Been Updated!This update introduces new Chapter and Stage Effects, as well as new Rival Events that recreate historic rivalries between generals.In addition, Sub Generals can now activate Equipment Skills, opening up even more possibilities for chaining multiple skills together.■ New Chapter & Stage EffectsChapters and stages can now feature special effects that influence battles.These include not only negative effects and debuffs, but also beneficial effects such as earning ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T07:49:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951309395","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4899480-1841579228664009","game_id":"steam-4899480","kind":"announcement","title":"Sanslo Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"You’ll start the game with a deck that’s already been 